WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.271
The integrated project uses a staging table with
messy customer data You

00:00:06.284 --> 00:00:11.942
will normalize text parse supported date formats
rank duplicate candidates and label records that

00:00:11.955 --> 00:00:17.465
need review The objective is a transparent
candidate-clean output

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:24.449
Unsupported or ambiguous values should remain
visible as uncertainty rather than being guessed
